  "high_level_description": "An editorial outdoor photograph of a young woman hiker in a coral-red waterproof jacket mid-stride on a wet grassy path across the green fells of the Lake District, with a second hiker ahead and Catbells rising under an overcast sky, shot on 35mm with Kodak Portra grain.",
