        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Young woman hiker mid-stride on the wet grassy path, anchored slightly right of center on the rule-of-thirds line, body filling roughly half the frame height as the focal subject. In three-quarter front view angled toward the camera, weight settled on her front foot. Bright coral-red lightweight waterproof jacket zipped to mid-chest, slight motion in the hem from her stride. Dark grey hiking trousers, scuffed brown leather hiking boots. Olive canvas daypack slung over both shoulders. Right hand adjusting the drawcord of her hood at her temple, left hand holding a rolled-up map at chest height. Medium skin tone, light brown hair tucked under the hood, gaze directed forward up the path toward the second hiker."
